<https://purl.org/fresh/terminologies/FSR3961> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://purl.org/fresh/Status> ;
                                               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "FSR3961" ;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Fiche finalisée par le contributeur. "@fr ,
                                                                                                "Record finalized by the contributor."@en ;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Awaiting validation"@en ,
                                                                                               "Envoyée pour publication"@fr .


###  https://purl.org/fresh/terminologies/FSR5292
<https://purl.org/fresh/terminologies/FSR5292> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
